  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_01",
      "hash64": "078D6045277CD5A9",
      "text": "身為寶可夢訓練家！\\n我真嚮往「最強」這兩個字啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_02",
      "hash64": "078D5D45277CD090",
      "text": "真希望哪天能看看\\n擁有最強之證的寶可夢啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_03",
      "hash64": "078D5E45277CD243",
      "text": "不是隨隨便便在哪裡都看得到，\\n所以才叫做最強啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_04",
      "hash64": "078D6345277CDAC2",
      "text": "那隻寶可夢……\\n並沒有最強之證啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_05",
      "hash64": "078D6445277CDC75",
      "text": "那隻寶可夢……\\n是最強的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]啊！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_06",
      "hash64": "078D6145277CD75C",
      "text": "哦哦哦……好厲害啊～！\\n真是我的偶像啊～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_006_boy_07",
      "hash64": "078D6245277CD90F",
      "text": "為了答謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，我就教[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一個\\n伽勒爾地區正流行的最強表情吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
